# CR 302.6, 605.1a: a creature's {T} ability can't be activated unless it has been under its controller's control continuously
# since their most recent turn began, and that includes a land that has become a creature. The Hall is played on turn 1 and
# animated the same turn by five Mox Rubies, so neither of its {T} mana abilities may be activated. (The control: on later turns
# the Hall taps as a creature, in great-hall-of-the-biblioplex-becomes-a-wizard-creature-and-gets-power-from-instants.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Great Hall of the Biblioplex
Mox Ruby
