Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#4.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#5.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Great Hall of the Biblioplex.Activate(Ability: {5})
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Great Hall of the Biblioplex.Types = Land; Creature
! Bot1.Battlefield.Great Hall of the Biblioplex.Activate(Ability: Pay 1 life)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Great Hall of the Biblioplex.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {C})

